TEXT -64 720 Left 2 !.lib fg_models.lib\n.tran 0 {3/f} {1/f} 10n\n.param f=10k fs=2Meg Vpk=5 Ksin=1 Ksq=0 Ktri=0\n.func PH(t) {f*floor(t*fs)/fs-floor(f*floor(t*fs)/fs)}\n.func SHAPE(p) {Ksin*sin(6.28318531*p)+Ksq*sgn(0.5-p)+Ktri*(1-4*abs(p-0.5))}\n.meas TRAN dac_max MAX V(DAC_OUT)\n.meas TRAN dac_min MIN V(DAC_OUT)\n.meas TRAN vref_n FIND V(VREF_N) AT={2/f}\n.meas TRAN vref_p FIND V(VREF_P) AT={2/f}\n.meas TRAN iout1_max MAX V(IOUT1)\n.meas TRAN iout1_min MIN V(IOUT1)
TEXT -64 1060 Left 1 ;Results print in View > SPICE Error Log. Expected values: README.md table T2.
